  "title": "Cinnamon-Coconut-Chocolate Chip Banana Bread",
  "description": "This riff on Cathy&#39;s Banana Bread incorporates reviewers&#39; suggestions and adds coconut and cinnamon, making it even more delicious and comforting.",
